The bug was caused by relying on capitalization differences to differentiate between two method names, `getId()` and `getID()`, which can lead to confusion and errors in method calls. This inconsistency was introduced in a previous commit, making it unclear which method should be used, resulting in potential runtime issues when comparing elements.

